OL,3,ATwo arrested after people seen
OL,4,Amysteriously emerging from various New
OL,5,AYork City sewers
OL,6,
OL,7,FNew York officials arrested two of
OL,8,Fthree men who they said were seen
OL,9,Femerging from a manhole, exiting the
OL,10,Fcity's underground sewer system on
OL,11,FWednesday.
OL,13,FThe New York Police Department (NYPD)
OL,14,Farrested 26-year-old Kevin Rodriguez
OL,15,Fand 25-year-old Samuel Reveron on
OL,16,Fcharges of conspiracy and trespassing.
OL,18,FThree men were seen exiting a manhole
OL,19,Fnear the hotel where Israeli Prime
OL,20,FMinister Benjamin Netanyahu was
OL,21,Freportedly expected to stay for the
OL,22,FUnited Nations General Assembly.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
