OL,3,ATwo arrested after people seen
OL,4,Amysteriously emerging from various New
OL,5,AYork City sewers
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a statement to the BBC, the NYPD
OL,8,Fsaid it had seen a number of incidents
OL,9,Finvolving people going into the sewer
OL,10,Fsystem to look for valuables and scrap
OL,11,Fmetal after a storm.
